{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape your experience - Your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Trials Survivors</strong></i> is a roguelite that fuses the simplicity of survivor-style gameplay with the loot-driven depth of hack and slash RPGs. Each skill is hand-crafted and endlessly upgradeable, letting you forge unique builds as you face trials set by the constellations. Overcome the odds, embrace the loot, and ascend into an unkillable god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.poster.avif?t=1760460466\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.webm?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.mp4?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/78dfc05b6ef2062393d58792ef9e4b77.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the stars, you must complete their Trials, survive impossible odds, and push back the encroaching darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple archetypes to define your starting loadout. Your main spell is aimed manually, while all other spells auto-target nearby enemies, letting you focus on movement, survival, and securing loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.poster.avif?t=1760460466\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.webm?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.mp4?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/7cbdf7c2b8868b86aa38950e83893f4e.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is divided into <strong>Trials</strong>,\u00a0cosmic challenges that test your skills, such as surviving for 5 minutes or defeating a set number of enemies before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing Trials rewards you with experience and upgrades. Collect new spells, enhance your powers, and build devastating synergies to unleash chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.poster.avif?t=1760460466\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.webm?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.mp4?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/23d6885be447b130918ef16a1e8131ee.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Relics</strong>,\u00a0powerful, socketable items that grant <strong>permanent progression</strong> and unlock more\u00a0<strong>player power</strong> in every run\u2026 if you choose to equip them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Relic grants stats: from global additional projectiles, to increased pierce, extra chain count, bonus damage, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a stat exists on a spell, chances are there\u2019s a Relic that can supercharge it. The result?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absolute build freedom, and total disregard for visual clarity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/dfb6aed351c56ea3de0abf43b4c1e921.avif?t=1760460466\" width=1200 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/bc061e62e7647fdd55d430efaa1bbe1e.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love <strong>monster density</strong>. This game was built from the ground up to handle absurd numbers of enemies and projectiles on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our dream? To let you craft <strong>an overpowered build worthy of the greatest Hack&amp;Slash games, in under 30 minutes of survival gameplay</strong>. And we truly believe we can deliver on that promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that sounds like your kind of chaos, we\u2019d love to have you on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DEMO CONTAIN</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Constellations &amp; their artworks !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 spells and 27 evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Biome and\u00a05 Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial game progression (class level)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial controller support (Not interactable in menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rough Edges (There is multiple elements that are work in progress, feel free to give us some feedback on whatever you feel like need some work !)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Game (We enjoy playing it and we hope you will too !)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092390?t=1760460466","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/708f4cbd60b0676ba1caf83c7a81ed6cb266a608/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760460466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/31b1a86c8222d754190358d6f3952c33334faca9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760460466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/31b1a86c8222d754190358d6f3952c33334faca9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760460466","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape your experience - Your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Trials Survivors</strong></i> is a roguelite that fuses the simplicity of survivor-style gameplay with the loot-driven depth of hack and slash RPGs. Each skill is hand-crafted and endlessly upgradeable, letting you forge unique builds as you face trials set by the constellations. Overcome the odds, embrace the loot, and ascend into an unkillable god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.poster.avif?t=1760460466\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.webm?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.mp4?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/78dfc05b6ef2062393d58792ef9e4b77.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the stars, you must complete their Trials, survive impossible odds, and push back the encroaching darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple archetypes to define your starting loadout. Your main spell is aimed manually, while all other spells auto-target nearby enemies, letting you focus on movement, survival, and securing loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.poster.avif?t=1760460466\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.webm?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.mp4?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/7cbdf7c2b8868b86aa38950e83893f4e.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is divided into <strong>Trials</strong>,\u00a0cosmic challenges that test your skills, such as surviving for 5 minutes or defeating a set number of enemies before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing Trials rewards you with experience and upgrades. Collect new spells, enhance your powers, and build devastating synergies to unleash chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.poster.avif?t=1760460466\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.webm?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.mp4?t=1760460466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/23d6885be447b130918ef16a1e8131ee.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Relics</strong>,\u00a0powerful, socketable items that grant <strong>permanent progression</strong> and unlock more\u00a0<strong>player power</strong> in every run\u2026 if you choose to equip them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Relic grants stats: from global additional projectiles, to increased pierce, extra chain count, bonus damage, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a stat exists on a spell, chances are there\u2019s a Relic that can supercharge it. The result?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absolute build freedom, and total disregard for visual clarity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/dfb6aed351c56ea3de0abf43b4c1e921.avif?t=1760460466\" width=1200 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/extras/bc061e62e7647fdd55d430efaa1bbe1e.avif?t=1760460466\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love <strong>monster density</strong>. This game was built from the ground up to handle absurd numbers of enemies and projectiles on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our dream? To let you craft <strong>an overpowered build worthy of the greatest Hack&amp;Slash games, in under 30 minutes of survival gameplay</strong>. And we truly believe we can deliver on that promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that sounds like your kind of chaos, we\u2019d love to have you on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DEMO CONTAIN</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Constellations &amp; their artworks !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 spells and 27 evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Biome and\u00a05 Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial game progression (class level)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial controller support (Not interactable in menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rough Edges (There is multiple elements that are work in progress, feel free to give us some feedback on whatever you feel like need some work !)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Game (We enjoy playing it and we hope you will too !)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Angry Wisp"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3762660","name":"Trials Survivors"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092390/28bb5af1ed330fc71ae5ad90a4e08a2273568ff8/header.jpg?t=1760460466","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Amd Ryzen 5600x Or Intel Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1650 or Equivalent</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092390/34446077/e95c3cfd79199390d91dea7ad2ffbc593ad106a2/1759788337/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759934344","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092390/34446077/e95c3cfd79199390d91dea7ad2ffbc593ad106a2/1759788337/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759934344","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092390/34446077/e95c3cfd79199390d91dea7ad2ffbc593ad106a2/1759788337/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759934344","id":257213226,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257213226/movie480.mp4?t=1759934344","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257213226/movie_max.mp4?t=1759934344"},"name":"Trials Survivor Game Reveal","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257213226/208ab387da22fdbbae4246a10b4957f1979826